`cargo test -p openbim-document` (150 + 2 passed). Note: the shared target 
directory may hold
artifacts from another worktree; if a build looks stale, `cargo clean -p 
<crate>` before rebuilding.
Do not run the whole workspace (CI does that in release).

**G12 — claims.** For each of the six P0 commit messages and the docs commit 
messages, say whether
the evidence supports every factual claim (counts, "verified", what each test 
